   | BetweenKeyword
   | IfKeyword
   | IsKeyword
   | OtherwiseKeyword
   | ThenKeyword
   | ElseKeyword
   | WhenKeyword
   | WhereKeyword
   | SuchThatKeyword
   | ActKeyword
   | EndKeyword
   | RecordKeyword
   | CitesKeyword
   | GroundsKeyword
   | ClaimKeyword
   | ProofKeyword
   | QedKeyword
   | InductionKeyword
   | ForAllKeyword
   | ThereExistsKeyword
   | LinearKeyword
